@startuml

actor User
participant "API Router" as Router
participant Controller
participant Service
participant Database

User -> Router: POST /api/spending (with spending data)
Router -> Controller: Call addSpending() with data
Controller -> Service: Call createSpendingService() with data
Service -> Database: Insert data into DB
Database --> Service: Success/Error response
Service --> Controller: Return result
Controller --> Router: Send response (success/error)
Router --> User: Return response (success/error)

@enduml
